== Sonnet

#poem[][

love is blind but love is also deaf: a touch a breath or\
flick of hair is all love needs; love needs no senses; neither\
is love senseless; no, love moves with purpose; gentle porter\
shifting parts of sep'rate hearts then assembling together.

love's divine: the clockwork of its mystery is itself\
obscure except as loving glances altered cadence breath\
blankets of soft words where hearts sleep holding poems bereft\
of tomorrow or yesterday just stuff of nows' todays.


